WEBVTT

00:02:29.937 --> 00:02:32.440
Shunday ekan, boshqa samaraliroq
usulga qaraymiz.

00:02:33.149 --> 00:02:37.987
Gigantning yoshi haqidagi farazlarni 
ko’rib chiqishga nima deysiz?

00:02:40.406 --> 00:02:43.492
Siz birinchi shamni yoqasiz,
oldinga 10 qadam yurasiz,

00:02:43.492 --> 00:02:47.538
Belgilangan sahmni o’chiring
va orqaga qayting.

00:02:47.622 --> 00:02:51.667
Agar boshlang’ich sham yoniq bo’lsa,
demak to’gri javob 10 emas.

00:02:51.918 --> 00:02:56.756
U o’chiq bo’lsa, javob 10 bo’lishi mumkin,
ammo bir nechta aylanishingiz ham mumkin.

00:02:56.756 --> 00:03:01.260
Shuning uchun 10ning ko’paytuvchilari -
5 va 2 ham javob bo’lishi mumkin.